# Download-on-demand sample media.
#
# The larger watermark-detection and keyed-mark sample files are served on
# demand (bundled with the app installer or downloaded on first use), not stored
# in this repository. See README.md. The small C2PA fixtures the integration
# suite reads (rAIdio.bot-sample, doomscroll.fm-sample, unsigned-sample) are
# committed and deliberately not matched below.

# Blind-detector samples at the examples/ root.
silentcipher-*.wav
trustmark-*.png
trustmark-*.mp4

# Keyed-mark samples and rendered demo panels (keyed-samples/ keeps its README).
keyed-samples/*.png
keyed-samples/*.wav
keyed-samples/*.mp4
